This directory (LDDC/) is a trimmed, headless copy of LDDC's lyrics-matching core,
integrated as-needed into the NASKTV downloader microservice so it can search/fetch
lyrics from QQ Music / Kugou / NetEase Cloud Music / Lrclib without the PySide6 GUI
dependency.

Modifications made during vendoring
-----------------------------------
1. LDDC/common/logger.py
   Replaced the PySide6-based logger (Qt message handler + on-disk file logging) with a
   stdlib logging adapter exposing the same `logger` object interface. No GUI, no files.

2. LDDC/common/data/cache.py
   Replaced the `diskcache`-backed cache (filesystem SQLite, pulls in PySide6 via
   common.data.config) with an in-memory dict stand-in (`cache.get`/`cache.set`,
   `cache.memoize()` decorator, and `cached_call_with_status`). No on-disk caching;
   results are fetched live per request.

3. LDDC/core/api/lyrics/__init__.py
   - Removed the module-level cached wrapper functions (search/get_songlist/
     get_lyricslist/get_lyrics) and the `cached_call_with_status` import.
   - Removed the `LocalAPI` (local-file) source from LyricsAPI.init(); only cloud
     sources (QQ/Kugou/NetEase/Lrclib) are wired up.

Removed (not needed for headless cloud lyrics)
----------------------------------------------
Whole subtrees / modules dropped: gui/, res/resource_rc.py (+ i18n, img, resource.qrc),
core/converter/, core/algorithm.py, core/song_info.py, core/auto_fetch.py,
core/api/translate/, core/api/lyrics/local.py, core/parser/{ass,srt,cue,json_lrc}.py,
common/data/config.py, common/data/local_song_lyrics_db.py, and the helper modules
common/{translator,task_manager,thread,paths,args,utils,path_processor}.py.

Retained data file: res/ne_deviceids.py (pure NetEase device-id data, no PySide6).

